{"title":"Gallery opening hours","genre":"analysis","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nA volunteer-run gallery can staff just two late openings per month, choosing between Thursday and Friday. Fictional historical observations for four late openings on each day give visitors, shop receipts, and volunteer hours. Thursday: 18/$92/6, 27/$145/6, 21/$110/5, 24/$128/6. Friday: 31/$125/8, 38/$184/8, 29/$142/7, 35/$160/8. Each proposed mix has a 15-hour monthly volunteer allowance. Compare visitors and receipts per volunteer hour, then model the three possible monthly mixes using historical averages and a high-hours scenario. Start from an empty directory and choose offline deliverables the gallery board can review before committing.","works":{"c2a8aa6f056e0ac2":{"files":[{"name":"Late openings - board brief.pdf","bytes":92804,"sha256":"cfbd75477788d13806647a4c0288f06daec45926e6cf8dfd5b461b5829b28dfd","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/cfbd75477788d13806647a4c0288f06daec45926e6cf8dfd5b461b5829b28dfd-page1.jpg"},{"name":"Late openings - planning model.xlsx","bytes":8555,"sha256":"76f5b14ac8d609408183c52e98366c0a5f78e7cb189b7cb4ea5b2b172d2f8d86","kind":"sheet","sheet":{"name":"Monthly plan","rows":[["Monthly late openings","","","","","","",""],["Edit the blue allowance cell or the eight opening records on the Observations sheet.","","","","","","",""],[],["Allowance (hours)","15"],[],["Historical performance per opening","","","","","","",""],["Day","Mean visitors","Mean receipts","Mean hours","Max hours","Visitors / hour","Receipts / hour"],["Thursday","22.5","118.75","5.75","6","3.9130434782608696","20.652173913043477"],["Friday","33.25","152.75","7.75","8","4.290322580645161","19.70967741935484"],[],["Two-opening monthly schedules","","","","","","",""],["Schedule","Thursdays","Fridays","Visitors","Receipts","Avg. hours","Avg. hours spare","High hours"]]}}],"download":"data/release/assets/f57974ea11ebb239b46946880452c42b423ed489cd12e3785d4dbafdec72fa61.zip"},"f374c2e20b65ce7b":{"files":[{"name":"Late Openings.html","bytes":11117,"sha256":"8d391d04c04c12396c3163bc4ba3c96140f161398bcf5e2ea7a2d9b639b72bff","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Late openings | Gallery board brief</title>\n<style>\n  :root { color-scheme: light; --paper: #faf8f2; --ink: #202c26; --muted: #4b5a51;\n    --line: #cbd2c7; --green: #234d39; --tint: #e9eee5; --over: #8a3328; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  main { max-width: 1020px; margin: auto; padding: 34px 34px 40px; }\n  header { border-top: 5px solid var(--green); padding-top: 17px; margin-bottom: 23px; }\n  .eyebrow { color: var(--green); font-size: .76em; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .13em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 4px; }\n  h1, h2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.1; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.1rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; margin: 0 0 8px; }\n  h2 { font-size: 1.65em; margin: 0 0 9px; }\n  p { margin: 0; }\n  .subtitle, .note { color: var(--muted); }\n  .decision { background: var(--green); color: white; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 25px; }\n  .decision p { max-width: 79ch; }\n  section { margin-top: 24px; }\n  .controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: end; gap: 8px 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  label { display: grid; gap: 3px; font-size: .9em; font-weight: 650; }\n  input, button { font: inherit; min-height: 44px; padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--green);\n    border-radius: 4px; }\n  input { width: 8em; background: white; color: var(--ink); }\n  button { background: var(--tint); color: var(--green); cursor: pointer; font-size: .9em; }\n  button:hover { background: #d8e1d5; }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #98531c; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .note { margin-top: 7px; font-size: .87em; }\n  .error, .over { color: var(--over); }\n  .error { font-size: .9em; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }\n  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: .93em; }\n  th, td { padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: right; }\n  thead th { background: var(--tint); color: var(--green); vertical-align: bottom; }\n  th:first-child { text-align: left; }\n  .scenario-table { min-width: 615px; }\n  .source-table { min-width: 490px; }\n  .group { text-align: center; }\n  .divider { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .margin { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9em; }\n  .margin.over { color: var(--over); font-weight: 650; }\n  .print-only { display: none; }\n  @media (max-width: 580px) {\n    main { padding: 20px 16px 28px; }\n    .decision { padding: 16px; }\n    th, td { padding: 7px; }\n  }\n  @page { size: letter; margin: .48in .55in; }\n  @media print {\n    :root { --paper: white; }\n    body { font-size: 11px; print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }\n    main { padding: 0; max-width: none; }\n    header { padding-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 13px; }\n    h1 { font-size: 39px; }\n    h2 { font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n    section { margin-top: 14px; break-inside: avoid; }\n    .decision { padding: 12px 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n    .decision p { max-width: none; }\n    th, td { padding: 4px 8px; }\n    .table-wrap { overflow: visible; }\n    .scenario-table, .source-table { min-width: 0; }\n    .controls, .error { display: none; }\n    .print-only { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    .note { font-size: 10px; margin-top: 5px; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <header>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Gallery board brief</p>\n    <h1>Late openings</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Two evenings per month · Thursday or Friday · 15 volunteer hours available</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <aside class=\"decision\" aria-labelledby=\"decision-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"decision-title\">Start with one Thursday and one Friday</h2>\n    <p>At the 15-hour allowance, this mix projects about 56 visitors and $271.50 in shop receipts, the highest totals among the mixes that fit both staffing scenarios. It leaves 1 hour in the high-hours case. Two Thursdays leave 3 hours in that case if the board wants more staffing flexibility.</p>\n  </aside>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"mix-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"mix-title\">Monthly schedule comparison</h2>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <label for=\"allowance\">Test an allowance (hours)\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"allowance\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"15\" required aria-describedby=\"allowance-error\">\n      </label>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"reset\">Reset to 15 hours</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"print\">Print brief</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"error\" id=\"allowance-error\" role=\"status\" hidden>Enter a nonnegative number of hours.</p>\n    <p class=\"print-only\">Allowance used for this comparison: <strong id=\"printed-allowance\"></strong></p>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"mix-title\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <table class=\"scenario-table\">\n        <thead><tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Two-opening mix</th><th scope=\"col\">Expected<br>visitors</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Expected shop<br>receipts</th><th scope=\"col\">Average<br>staffing</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">High-hours<br>staffing</th>\n        </tr></thead>\n        <tbody id=\"mixes\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Projections add the historical per-opening averages. High-hours staffing uses the highest observed hours per opening for each weekday (6 on Thursday, 8 on Friday), with the same visitor and receipt projections.</p>\n    <noscript><p>The interactive model requires JavaScript. The companion PDF contains the complete 15-hour comparison.</p></noscript>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"efficiency-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"efficiency-title\">What each volunteer hour returns</h2>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"efficiency-title\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Weekday</th><th scope=\"col\">Visitors per hour</th><th scope=\"col\">Shop receipts per hour</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody id=\"efficiency\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Friday drew more visitors per hour. Thursday took in more per hour. Each rate divides the weekday’s total visitors or receipts by its total volunteer hours.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"history-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"history-title\">Historical observations</h2>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"history-title\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <table class=\"source-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th></th><th scope=\"colgroup\" colspan=\"3\" class=\"group divider\">Thursday</th><th scope=\"colgroup\" colspan=\"3\" class=\"group divider\">Friday</th></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"col\">Opening</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"divider\">Visitors</th><th scope=\"col\">Receipts</th><th scope=\"col\">Hours</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"divider\">Visitors</th><th scope=\"col\">Receipts</th><th scope=\"col\">Hours</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody id=\"history\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">The projections use four fictional observations per weekday. Actual attendance, receipts and staffing may vary.</p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n  'use strict';\n  // Observations are ordered as visitors, shop receipts, and volunteer hours.\n  const observations = {\n    Thursday: [[18, 92, 6], [27, 145, 6], [21, 110, 5], [24, 128, 6]],\n    Friday: [[31, 125, 8], [38, 184, 8], [29, 142, 7], [35, 160, 8]]\n  };\n  const schedules = [\n    ['Two Thursdays', 'Thursday', 'Thursday'],\n    ['Thursday + Friday', 'Thursday', 'Friday'],\n    ['Two Fridays', 'Friday', 'Friday']\n  ];\n  const defaultAllowance = 15;\n  const number = new Intl.NumberFormat('en', { maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\n  const currency = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD' });\n  const summaries = Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(observations).map(([day, rows]) => {\n    const totals = rows[0].map((_, column) => rows.reduce((sum, row) => sum + row[column], 0));\n    return [day, {\n      totals,\n      averages: totals.map(total => total / rows.length),\n      highHours: Math.max(...rows.map(row => row[2]))\n    }];\n  }));\n  const allowance = document.querySelector('#allowance');\n  const error = document.querySelector('#allowance-error');\n  const mixRows = document.querySelector('#mixes');\n\n  function staffingCell(hours, limit) {\n    const remaining = limit - hours;\n    let status = 'At limit';\n    if (remaining > 0) status = number.format(remaining) + ' h left';\n    if (remaining < 0) status = number.format(-remaining) + ' h over';\n    if (remaining !== 0 && Math.abs(remaining) < 0.01) {\n      status = remaining > 0 ? '&lt;0.01 h left' : '&lt;0.01 h over';\n    }\n    return '<td>' + number.format(hours) + ' h<span class=\"margin' +\n      (remaining < 0 ? ' over' : '') + '\">' + status + '</span></td>';\n  }\n\n  function renderSchedules() {\n    const valid = allowance.validity.valid && Number.isFinite(allowance.valueAsNumber);\n    const limit = valid ? allowance.valueAsNumber : defaultAllowance;\n    error.hidden = valid;\n    if (!valid) error.textContent = 'Enter a nonnegative number of hours. The table is showing the 15-hour allowance.';\n    allowance.setAttribute('aria-invalid', String(!valid));\n    document.querySelector('#printed-allowance').textContent = limit + ' h';\n    mixRows.innerHTML = schedules.map(([label, first, second]) => {\n      const a = summaries[first];\n      const b = summaries[second];\n      const [visitors, receipts, hours] = a.averages.map((value, index) => value + b.averages[index]);\n      return '<tr><th scope=\"row\">' + label + '</th><td>' + number.format(visitors) +\n        '</td><td>' + currency.format(receipts) + '</td>' + staffingCell(hours, limit) +\n        staffingCell(a.highHours + b.highHours, limit) + '</tr>';\n    }).join('');\n  }\n\n  function historyCells([visitors, receipts, hours]) {\n    return '<td class=\"divider\">' + number.format(visitors) + '</td><td>' +\n      currency.format(receipts) + '</td><td>' + number.format(hours) + '</td>';\n  }\n\n  document.querySelector('#history').innerHTML = observations.Thursday.map((row, index) =>\n    '<tr><th scope=\"row\">' + (index + 1) + '</th>' + historyCells(row) +\n    historyCells(observations.Friday[index]) + '</tr>'\n  ).join('') + '<tr><th scope=\"row\">Average</th>' + historyCells(summaries.Thursday.averages) +\n    historyCells(summaries.Friday.averages) + '</tr>';\n\n  document.querySelector('#efficiency').innerHTML = Object.entries(summaries).map(([day, { totals }]) => {\n    const [visitors, receipts, hours] = totals;\n    return '<tr><th scope=\"row\">' + day + '</th><td>' + (visitors / hours).toFixed(2) +\n      '</td><td>' + currency.format(receipts / hours) + '</td></tr>';\n  }).join('');\n\n  allowance.addEventListener('input', renderSchedules);\n  document.querySelector('#reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    allowance.value = defaultAllowance;\n    renderSchedules();\n  });\n  document.querySelector('#print').addEventListener('click', () => window.print());\n  renderSchedules();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},{"name":"Late Openings.pdf","bytes":27849,"sha256":"188eaf0cdb109e72848bb200b271f4fc56f017106dbd607f5469a8b930ec04c2","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/188eaf0cdb109e72848bb200b271f4fc56f017106dbd607f5469a8b930ec04c2-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/3eb6f02980d61887b29c62fb9071dde211c44a88c59d2f23aa7b63550966249c.zip"}}}
